<title>UK: Flextech chief sells shares to TCI-paper.</title>
<headline>Flextech chief sells shares to TCI-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flextech Plc chief executive Roger Luard sold most of his Flextech shares to Tele-Communications International Inc of the U.S., the Times said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Luard sold almost 700,000 shares at 622-1/2p each, receiving about 4.3 million stg. He acquired 192,000 of the shares on Monday when he exercised options at 324p, the paper said. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
